    "description": "Velocity FBO Network operates fixed-base operator locations that provide fueling, hangar, ground handling, and related services for business aviation customers. Its customers or end markets include business aircraft operators, charter providers, and general aviation users. The operating model is an asset-backed airport services model centered on leased or owned FBO facilities and recurring operating revenue. Operations are concentrated in Michigan, Florida, and Georgia, with expansion into additional U.S. airports. Public materials indicate an initial platform assembled from Odyssey Aviation’s U.S. assets and subsequent add-on acquisitions. Current ownership dates to Tallvine Partners’ 2025 launch of the North America FBO platform using Odyssey Aviation’s U.S. assets, followed by the rebrand to Velocity FBO Network in June 2025.",
